      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "`alloc`: The allocator to use to allocate memory for the new object. Pass `NULL` or kCFAllocatorDefault to use the current default allocator.",
      "normalizedSource": "`alloc`: The allocator to use to allocate memory for the new object. Pass `NULL` or kCFAllocatorDefault to use the current default allocator.",
